[Landlord letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Rental reference for {{tenantName}}

To the leasing office,

I am the {{landlordName}} of record for {{propertyAddress}}. I am writing to confirm the tenancy of {{tenantName}} at that address.

{{tenantName}} rented the unit from {{moveIn}}{{#moveOut}} through {{moveOut}}{{/moveOut}}{{^moveOut}} and is a current tenant{{/moveOut}}. The monthly rent was {{rentAmount}}. During the tenancy the tenant {{latePayments}}, and {{notices}}.

{{#condition}}{{condition}}

{{/condition}}{{rentAgain}}.

If you would like to confirm any of the above, I can be reached at {{landlordContact}}.

Sincerely,

{{landlordName}}
Owner / property manager, {{propertyAddress}}
{{landlordContact}}

Subject: Reference request for {{propertyAddress}}

Hello {{landlordName}},

I am applying for a rental and the leasing office has asked for a reference from a previous landlord. Would you be willing to write a short one for my tenancy at {{propertyAddress}}?

To save you the lookup, here is what I have on record. Please correct anything that does not match your own records:

  Tenant:        {{tenantName}}
  Address:       {{propertyAddress}}
  Tenancy:       {{moveIn}}{{#moveOut}} to {{moveOut}}{{/moveOut}}
  Monthly rent:  {{rentAmount}}

The leasing office is looking for the dates, the rent, my payment record, and whether you would rent to me again. A short paragraph on your letterhead or from your business email is enough — it does not need to be long.

If company policy limits you to confirming dates and rent without an opinion, that is fine and useful on its own. Please send whatever you are able to.

The letter should go to: {{recipient}}

Thank you for your time,
{{tenantName}}

[Landlord letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Tenancy confirmation — {{tenantName}}

This confirms the following tenancy record for {{propertyAddress}}:

  Tenant of record:   {{tenantName}}
  Tenancy start:      {{moveIn}}
  Tenancy end:        {{moveOut}}
  Monthly rent:       {{rentAmount}}
  Payment record:     The tenant {{latePayments}}.
  Notice history:     During the tenancy, {{notices}}.

Company policy limits this office to confirming the factual tenancy record above. No opinion regarding the tenant is offered or implied by this confirmation, and none should be inferred from its absence.

Questions about this record may be directed to {{landlordContact}}.

{{landlordName}}
{{landlordContact}}

RENTAL VERIFICATION

Completed by: {{landlordName}}
Contact:      {{landlordContact}}
Returned to:  {{requesterName}} — {{returnTo}}
Date:         [date completed]

TENANCY
  Tenant of record ......... {{tenantName}}
  Co-tenant on lease ....... {{coTenant}}
  Address .................. {{propertyAddress}}
  Lease start .............. {{leaseStart}}
  Lease end ................ {{leaseEnd}}

RENT
  Monthly rent ............. {{monthlyRent}}
  Balance outstanding ...... {{balanceOwed}}
  Late payments ............ {{lateCount}}

TENANCY RECORD
  Notices served ........... {{noticeHistory}}
  Security deposit ......... {{depositOutcome}}
  Would rent again ......... {{rentAgain}}

I confirm the above is taken from this office's tenancy records for the address named.

Signature ______________________________  Date ____________
Print name and title ___________________________________

VERIFICATION OF EMPLOYMENT

To:      {{requesterName}}
Return:  {{returnTo}}
For:     {{purpose}}{{#returnBy}}
Needed by: {{returnBy}}{{/returnBy}}

EMPLOYER
  Legal name ............... {{employerName}}
  Worksite address ......... {{employerAddress}}

EMPLOYEE
  Full legal name .......... {{employeeName}}
  Job title ................ {{jobTitle}}
  Position type ............ {{employmentType}}
  Date of hire ............. {{startDate}}
  Current status ........... {{status}}
  Separation date .......... {{endDate}}

COMPENSATION (complete only if the employee's signed release is on file)
  Base pay rate ............ {{payRate}}
  Pay frequency ............ {{payFrequency}}
  Average hours per week ... {{hoursPerWeek}}

I confirm the information above is taken from this employer's payroll and personnel records.

  Verifier ................. {{verifierName}}
  Direct contact ........... {{verifierContact}}

  Signature ______________________________   Date ____________

Please return this completed form directly to {{returnTo}}. Do not return it by way of the employee.

AUTHORIZATION TO RELEASE EMPLOYMENT AND INCOME INFORMATION

I, {{employeeName}}, am {{status}} at {{employerName}}.

I authorize {{employerName}}, its payroll department, and any verification service acting on its behalf, to release my employment and income information to {{requesterName}} at {{returnTo}}.

The information I am authorizing to be released is limited to: my job title, my position type, my date of hire{{#endDate}} and separation date{{/endDate}}, my current employment status, my base pay rate, my pay frequency, and my average weekly hours.

This authorization is given for the purpose of {{purpose}}{{#returnBy}} and is valid through {{returnBy}}{{/returnBy}}. A copy of this authorization may be relied upon as though it were the original.

  Employee signature ______________________________   Date ____________

  Print name ..... {{employeeName}}
  Job title ...... {{jobTitle}}
  Employer ....... {{employerName}}

[{{employerName}} letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Employment verification for {{employeeName}}

To the leasing office,

This confirms that {{employeeName}} is employed by {{employerName}} as a {{employmentType}} {{jobTitle}}. {{employeeName}} began employment on {{startDate}} and is currently employed in that position.

{{#salary}}Current compensation is {{salary}}, paid {{payFrequency}}.{{/salary}}{{#hoursPerWeek}} Scheduled hours average {{hoursPerWeek}} per week.{{/hoursPerWeek}}

I am authorized to verify this information on behalf of {{employerName}}. Please contact me at {{signerContact}} if you would like to confirm any part of it.

Sincerely,

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}
{{signerContact}}

[{{employerName}} letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Verification of employment — {{employeeName}}

To the underwriting department,

This letter verifies the employment of {{employeeName}} with {{employerName}}.

  Position ............ {{jobTitle}}
  Position type ....... {{employmentType}}
  Date of hire ........ {{startDate}}
  Current status ...... {{#endDate}}Employment ended {{endDate}}{{/endDate}}{{^endDate}}Actively employed as of the date of this letter{{/endDate}}
  Base compensation ... {{salary}}, paid {{payFrequency}}
  Scheduled hours ..... {{hoursPerWeek}} per week

The compensation stated above is the employee's base pay. This employer does not make representations about future earnings, continued employment, or bonus and overtime amounts that have not yet been earned.

I am authorized by {{employerName}} to release this verification. Direct enquiries to {{signerContact}}.

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}

[{{employerName}} letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Employment and income verification — {{employeeName}}

To the eligibility caseworker,

This confirms the employment of {{employeeName}} with {{employerName}}.

  Job title ................ {{jobTitle}}
  Position type ............ {{employmentType}}
  Date of hire ............. {{startDate}}
  Employment status ........ {{#endDate}}Ended {{endDate}}{{/endDate}}{{^endDate}}Currently employed{{/endDate}}
  Average hours per week ... {{hoursPerWeek}}
  Rate of pay .............. {{salary}}
  Pay frequency ............ {{payFrequency}}

Pay stubs for the most recent pay periods can be provided on request and will show gross pay and pay dates for the period your office is reviewing.

I am authorized to verify this information on behalf of {{employerName}} and can be reached at {{signerContact}}.

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}

[{{employerName}} letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Employment verification — {{employeeName}}

To whom it may concern at {{recipient}},

I am an authorized representative of {{employerName}} and I am writing to confirm the employment of {{employeeName}}.

{{employeeName}} has been employed by {{employerName}} since {{startDate}} in the {{employmentType}} position of {{jobTitle}}{{#endDate}}, through {{endDate}}{{/endDate}}. Current annual compensation is {{salary}}, paid {{payFrequency}}, for an average of {{hoursPerWeek}} hours per week.

{{#duties}}The position involves the following: {{duties}}

{{/duties}}This letter states the employment record as it exists on the date signed. It makes no representation regarding future employment, future sponsorship, or any immigration determination, which are outside this employer's control.

I can be reached at {{signerContact}} to confirm any part of this letter.

Sincerely,

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}

[Client letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Confirmation of contracted work — {{employeeName}}

To whom it concerns,

This confirms that {{employeeName}} has performed contracted work for {{employerName}} beginning {{startDate}}{{#endDate}} and continuing through {{endDate}}{{/endDate}}{{^endDate}} and continuing on an ongoing basis{{/endDate}}.

{{#duties}}The scope of the engagement is: {{duties}}

{{/duties}}{{#salary}}Amounts paid under this engagement are {{salary}}, billed {{payFrequency}}.

{{/salary}}{{employeeName}} is an independent contractor and not an employee of {{employerName}}. Payments made are reported as contractor payments, and this confirmation is not a guarantee of future work.

I can confirm the above at {{signerContact}}.

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}

[{{employerName}} letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Employment record — {{employeeName}}

To whom it concerns,

This confirms that {{employeeName}} was employed by {{employerName}} as a {{employmentType}} {{jobTitle}} from {{startDate}} to {{endDate}}.

{{#salary}}Compensation at the time of separation was {{salary}}, paid {{payFrequency}}.{{/salary}}

The employment record for {{employeeName}} is closed as of {{endDate}}. Company policy limits this office to confirming dates, position, and compensation; no statement regarding the circumstances of separation is offered or implied, and none should be inferred from its absence.

Enquiries may be directed to {{signerContact}}.

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}

[{{employerName}} letterhead]

[Date]

{{recipient}}

Re: Proof of employment — {{employeeName}}

To whom it concerns,

This confirms that {{employeeName}} is employed by {{employerName}} as a {{employmentType}} {{jobTitle}}, hired on {{startDate}}. As of the date of this letter, {{employeeName}} is {{status}}.

{{#grossPay}}Gross pay is {{grossPay}} per pay period, paid {{payFrequency}}.{{/grossPay}}{{#ytd}} Year-to-date gross earnings through the most recent pay period are {{ytd}}, which will agree with the pay stub enclosed with this letter.{{/ytd}}

This letter confirms the employment record as it stands today. It is not a representation about continued employment or future earnings.

I am authorized to verify this information for {{employerName}} and can be reached directly at {{signerContact}}.

Sincerely,

{{signerName}}
{{employerName}}
{{signerContact}}

{{recipient}}

[Date]

Re: Proof of employment — {{employeeName}}

Enclosed is documentation of my employment with {{employerName}}, where I have worked as a {{employmentType}} {{jobTitle}} since {{startDate}}. I am {{status}}.

Enclosed:

{{enclosures}}

The figures agree across the documents: gross pay of {{grossPay}} paid {{payFrequency}}, with year-to-date gross of {{ytd}} on the most recent stub.

